    "html": "<p>Fantastic analysis. I think there is quite a lot of room for collective bargaining with the AI researchers (including datacenter operators and other workers maintaining uptime of frontier models) *across* all major American labs, with concrete demands. This is something that has proven to be possible with Starbucks Workers United. Ultimately, the Left needs to demand the socialization of the surplus profits by AI companies.</p>",
